    "description": "Why re-introduce the death penalty now?",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/opinion/Why-re-introduce-the-death-penalty-now/172-348017",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailymirrorlk",
