    "chunk_text": "Mother and paramour arrested over abandonment of 4-year-old girl\n\nColombo, August 14 (Daily Mirror) - Police have arrested a woman and a man in connection with the abandonment of a four-year-old girl on Gammedda Road in Yatirawana Mudune, Wattegama yesterday.\n\nAccording to reports, the child had been brought to the area in a three-wheeler before being abandoned there.\n\nThe two suspects were arrested by officers attached to the Hali Ela Police Station today. The female suspect is reportedly the mother of the child, while the male suspect is alleged to be her paramour.\n\nThe suspects are expected to be handed over to the Wattegama Police Station, which will conduct further investigations into the circumstances surrounding the incident."
