    "description": "Sajith welcomes UN expert\u2019s concerns over 22nd Amendment",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/news/Sajith-welcomes-UN-expert-s-concerns-over-22nd-Amendment/56-796047",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailyftlk",
