    "chunk_text": "Recognising the importance of safety during the Poson season, AIA Insurance once again partnered with the Sri Lanka Police, Sri Lanka Life Saving Association, Sri Lanka Navy and the Civil Security Department to deploy more than 530 lifeguards across 44 reservoirs and water bodies in Anuradhapura and surrounding areas. This year alone, the programme helped save six lives, further strengthening its long-standing impact.\n\nIn partnership with the Cancer Society of Sri Lanka, AIA conducted an oral cancer awareness and screening programme that benefited more than 250 individuals. To enhance convenience and accessibility for the pilgrims, AIA Insurance collaborated with the Defence Ministry \u2013 Centre for Defence Research and Development to introduce a digital map service. The platform enabled the devotees to easily locate essential services including parking areas, drinking water facilities, toilets, medical camps, safe bathing locations, dansal and emergency contact points throughout the sacred city.\n\nThe application recorded more than 267,000 users throughout the pilgrimage season, making it one of the most widely utilised digital services available to pilgrims."
