    "chunk_text": "What is even stranger perhaps is that even in the EU countries, attacks on the LGBTIQ community are growing. Data and human rights reports indicate that harassment, hate speech, and physical attacks targeting the LGBTQ+ community are growing across parts of Europe.\n\nBefore demanding that\u00a0 Lankans decriminalise same-sex relations immediately to receive GSP+ benefits, it may be better if the EU invested in\u00a0 programmes to convince our now blind-sighted people to accept the \u2018new concept\u2019 the EU is asking us to embrace. If not, the backlash may lead to further alienation of the community they seek to protect."
