    "description": "Abans brings \u2018Living Just Right with LG AI\u2019 to Colombo City Centre",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/business-news/Abans-brings-Living-Just-Right-with-LG-AI-to-Colombo-City-Centre/273-348212",
    "lang": "en",
