    "chunk_text": "90 journalists receive laptops and mobile phones\n\nFor the first time in Sri Lankan media history, laptops and mobile phones have been provided to 90 journalists. The initiative, organised by the Sri Lanka Tamil Journalists Association with the financial support of London-based businessman and social worker Seevaratnam Mures, provided laptops and mobile phones to 90 Tamil and Muslim journalists from several districts across the island."
