    "chunk_text": "Keheliya appears before Bribery Commission in wheelchair\n\nColombo, Aug. 18 (Daily Mirror) - Former Health Minister Keheliya Rambukwella recently appeared before the Commission to Investigate Allegations of Bribery or Corruption (CIABOC) in a wheelchair to provide a statement in connection with an ongoing investigation.\n\nThe former Minister was questioned as part of the Commission\u2019s continuing inquiries into the matter."
