    "description": "When the risk is judicial independence, a President must not take it",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/When-the-risk-is-judicial-independence-a-President-must-not-take-it/4-796178",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailyftlk",
    "time_ut": 1787036059.0,
