    "chunk_text": "World Photography Day held\n\nWorld Photography Day celebrations organized by the Gampaha District Photographers\u2019 Association were held today (18) at the Wave and Lake Festival Hall in Welisara, with the participation of photographers and professional photography studio owners from across the island. The event was presided over by Minister Vijitha Herath, while a commemorative stamp was also issued to mark the occasion."
