    "description": "US states call for big changes to Instagram and Facebook as Meta child privacy trial begins",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/breaking-news/US-states-call-for-big-changes-to-Instagram-and-Facebook-as-Meta-child-privacy-trial-begins/108-348380",
